  partName: Oil Pan Gasket (3)
  description: The Oil Pan Gasket (3) is a tiny, thin-flat component located at the
    bottom-center-front of the engine, made of Material.001, responsible for sealing
    the oil pan and preventing oil leaks. Its small size and specific material allow
    it to fit perfectly in the engine's design, and a notable aspect is its compatibility
    with various engine types.
